      "widgets_values": [
        "A towering battle-mech sentinel standing in a ruined industrial yard at dusk, heavy armor plates scarred and weathered, glowing furnace-core beneath cracked metal. Thick smoke drifts through the air as wind pushes debris across the ground. The mech’s eyes burn with dim red light, reflecting off wet pavement. Small sparks fall from exposed wiring near the shoulder. Distant fires flicker behind collapsing structures. Volumetric fog, high-contrast rim light, cinematic detail, sharp mechanical geometry, hyper-detailed textures, controlled color palette of steel, ember orange, and deep shadows. Dramatic atmosphere, depth, weight, realism.\n"
      ]
